{"_note":"来源与边界声明(标准 §7:数据来源必须在页面上说清楚)。这是包改名的由来 —— 它只看得见 App Store 的公开面,不接 App Store Connect(那要 .p8 私钥,撞零密钥硬闸)。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"t","type":"txt","x":"0pt","y":"0pt","w":"{parent.w}","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.foot}","fontSize":"11pt","lineSpacing":"4pt","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"5"}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"foot":"评分和版本来自 App Store 公开数据，不需要密钥。你自己 App 的下载、收益、审核和性能来自 App Store Connect，密钥和关注列表默认只存在这台设备上。"},"en-US":{"foot":"Ratings and versions come from public App Store data, no key needed. Your own apps' downloads, proceeds, review status and performance come from App Store Connect; the key and your watchlist stay on this device by default."}}}}
